# Cloudflare Pages response headers.
#
# These apply to the static app (the HTML document and assets). Pages Functions
# set their own headers where needed (the file-streaming endpoints already send
# their own strict CSP and nosniff).
#
# Smoke-tested on production 2026-11-23:
#  - static.cloudflareinsights.com is allowed in script-src and
#    cloudflareinsights.com in connect-src, because Cloudflare injects its Web
#    Analytics beacon on Pages sites (CSP was blocking it).
#  - Stripe: js.stripe.com (script+frame), hooks.stripe.com and m.stripe.network
#    (frame, the fraud-detection iframe), api.stripe.com (connect), *.stripe.com
#    (img), per https://docs.stripe.com/security/guide#content-security-policy.
# Still verify the logged-in rent-payment flow and the in-app PDF viewer; widen
# the Stripe hosts further only if the payment form reports a blocked resource.

/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(self)
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains; preload
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; base-uri 'self'; object-src 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; script-src 'self' https://js.stripe.com https://static.cloudflareinsights.com; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' https://fonts.gstatic.com data:; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://*.stripe.com; connect-src 'self' https://api.stripe.com https://cloudflareinsights.com; frame-src https://js.stripe.com https://hooks.stripe.com https://m.stripe.network; worker-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; form-action 'self'
